OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fa band of heavy rain spreading east
OL,7,Fthrough the evening, accompanied by
OL,8,Fstrong winds and severe coastal gales.
OL,9,FRain clears east overnight, leaving
OL,10,Fclear skies and easing winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA dry morning with
OL,13,Fprolonged sunny spells. A little
OL,14,Fcloudier in the afternoon with bright
OL,15,For sunny intervals and showers
OL,16,Fpossible. Brisk winds.
