OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMostly dry with sunny spells Thursday,
OL,7,Fcloudier with rain spreading east in
OL,8,Fthe evening. Variable cloud Friday and
OL,9,FSaturday with some bright spells
OL,10,Fbetween rain or showers. Breezy at
OL,11,Ftimes.
